<!-- GREENTIDE_FREE_ROSTER_OWNED_1. The Lunger: replaces the alligator placeholder. Invented, franchise-free (Q11a).
     RM_CompAquaticAmbusher is CompProperties_AquaticAmbusher (Mod Settings toggle 11 governs it); the silence aura
     moved here from the vanilla Warg and fires on its hunt job. -->

<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Dhollock</defName>
    <label>dhollock</label>
    <description>A long, flat river ambusher, back mottled slate-blue and the eye-ridges ochre, mouth running nearly the width of its head. It sits inside deep water where nothing shows but the stillness, and the first anyone knows of it is the lunge. It takes what wades or drinks; it does not chase far, and the whole bank goes quiet when one is hunting.</description>
